            "title": "黑期跌239點  ADR低175點  網易低水近12%",
            "description": "<div class=\"article-body\">\n<p class=\"font-size-scaler-control\" data-font=\"16\" style=\"font-weight: 400;\">黑期跌239點或1.05%，報22,570。</p>\n<p class=\"font-size-scaler-control\" data-font=\"16\" style=\"font-weight: 400;\">摩根大通港股ADR指數較周五恒指收市低175點或0.8%，報22,665點。</p>\n<a class=\"image-lightbox\" data-fancybox=\"gallery-mainpost\" href=\"https://image.bastillepost.com/704x/wp-content/uploads/hongkong/2026/11/09999網易_fb-1-1-1.jpg.webp\">\n<img src=\"https://image.bastillepost.com/704x/wp-content/uploads/hongkong/2026/11/09999網易_fb-1-1-1.jpg.webp\"/>\n</a>\n<p class=\"font-size-scaler-control\" data-font=\"16\" style=\"font-weight: 400;\">阿里巴巴(09988)ADR較港收市價高1.4%，折合81.7元，貢獻恒指21點 ; 京東(09618) ADR較港收市價高1.9%，折合100.51元 ; 騰訊(00700) ADR較港收市價低0.7%，折合346.43元。網易(09999)績後轉弱， ADR較港收市價低11.9%，折合164.74元，影響恒指58點，為跌市主力。</p>\n\n<p class=\"font-size-scaler-control\" data-font=\"16\" style=\"font-weight: 400;\">聯想(00992)ADR收市折合港幣15.67元，較港收市價低3.5%。</p>\n<p class=\"font-size-scaler-control\" data-font=\"16\" style=\"font-weight: 400;\">滙控(00005) ADR較香港收市價低1.9%，折合130.77港元，影響恒指31點。建設銀行(00005) ADR較香港收市價低0.9%，折合10.39港元，影響恒指12點。</p>\n<p class=\"font-size-scaler-control\" data-font=\"16\" style=\"font-weight: 400;\">恒指夜市期指收報22759點，跌49點，較昨日恒指收市22841點，低水83點，成交2萬張。國指夜市期指收報7672點，較昨日國指收市低水18點。</p>\n</div>",
            "link": "https://www.bastillepost.com/hongkong/article/17221654-%e9%bb%91%e6%9c%9f%e8%b7%8c239%e9%bb%9e-adr%e4%bd%8e175%e9%bb%9e-%e7%b6%b2%e6%98%93%e4%bd%8e%e6%b0%b4%e8%bf%9112",
            "image": "https://image.bastillepost.com/704x369/wp-content/uploads/hongkong/2025/04/HKSTOCK-3.jpg.webp",
            "pub_date": "2026-11-20 08:50:35",
